@startuml
title Figure 4b - Activity Diagram: Single Procedure Execution inside an A6 Instance (called per procedure from Figure 4a-2)\n[Individual task · Member C]\nEngine split, output validation, A7 independent review, Loop 1, auto-disposition, safe point

skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam legendFontSize 20
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor White
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #444444
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #888800
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond

|Human|
|Concierge|
|Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
|LLM Agent|

|Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
start
:Procedure -> executing, entry action: new ProcedureRun
(trigger from caller: initial / loop2_extend / rerun /
needs_review / correction), loop1Rounds = 0;
switch (Procedure engine?)
case (rule)
  :RuleEngine runs SQL on FinancialDataStore
  -> Exceptions with EvidencePointers
  (no reasoning chain, no A7);
case (manual)
  |Concierge|
  :Assign task to RCA
  (stocktake, interview) with checklist;
  |Human|
  :Perform procedure, report result
  and upload evidence;
  |Concierge|
  :Collect result;
  |Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
  :Record result and evidence (no A7);
case (hybrid / llm)
  :hybrid only: RuleEngine pre-filters
  candidates (e.g. GEN-05 -> GEN-02);
  repeat
    |LLM Agent|
    :A6 generates Judgment: structured output,
    reasoning chain, counter-argument;
    |Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
    switch (OutputValidator (8.6)?)
    case (format error, 2 retries exhausted)
      :Fallback: hybrid keeps rule result
      flagged unattributed, llm marks
      ProcedureRun failed;
      break
    case (some pointers invalid)
      :Keep the Judgment, flag those steps
      unsupported, evidence coverage drops,
      continue through 7.4 and 8.4;
    case (no valid pointer, or semantic check fails)
      :Keep the Judgment, flag it for a human
      (7.4 downgrade), nothing discarded;
    case (valid)
      :Judgment accepted;
    endswitch
    if (GEN-09 trigger hit?) then (yes)
      |LLM Agent|
      :A7 reviews: round 1 independent conclusion
      from evidence only, round 2 compare
      -> criticVerdict, criticReasonType;
      |Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
    else (no)
      :criticVerdict = skipped;
    endif
  backward :Loop 1: A6 gathers more evidence (system data only),\nnew ProcedureRun (loop1_retry), loop1Rounds + 1,\nold Judgment -> supersededBy;
  repeat while (Loop 1 needed?\nA6 self-judged evidence insufficient, or A7 inconsistent\nfor insufficient_evidence, loop1Rounds < 3, new evidence found) is (yes) not (no)
  if (A7 still inconsistent?) then (yes)
    :Flag as dispute (adjudication lane,
    no confidence ranking, no blind);
  else (no)
  endif
endswitch
|Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
:Apply downgrade rules (7.4), compute confidence (8.4)
(manual: skipped, the human's result is final),
package Run, Exceptions and Judgments into the StatePatch
(A1 writes them to AuditOutputStore after fan-in);
if (Human needed?\nmanual: never (the result is the human's own),\neffective level L1 / L2 or blind, 9.1 mandatory rows,\nA7 inconsistent, dispute, failed / unattributed, stale) then (yes)
  :Draft ReviewTask (kind normal / dispute / unattributed / failed,
  target = Judgment, Exception, ProcedureRun or Procedure + version)
  into the StatePatch, A1 publishes it after fan-in,
  Procedure -> awaiting_human (dispute -> in_dispute);
else (no: L3 normal / L4)
  if (timing = interim and period not covered?) then (yes)
    :Procedure -> interim_completed,
    waits for the linked GEN-24 instance;
  else (no)
    :Auto-close: Procedure -> completed,
    result recorded;
  endif
  if (9.2 sample: 5% of high-confidence Judgments?) then (yes)
    :Draft ReviewTask kind blind
    (conclusion hidden at presentation);
  else (no)
  endif
endif
if (Safe point: result hits Loop 3 blocking condition?\nfraud indicator, uncorrected > 70% of OM,\nundisclosed related party, major subsequent event) then (yes)
  :Raise reassessment flag: all instances stop
  at next safe point, A1 stops dispatching;
else (no)
endif
stop

legend right
  |= Lane |= Who |
  | Human | RCA; manual-engine procedures only, via Concierge |
  | Concierge | A10; assigns manual tasks, collects results verbatim |
  | Orchestrator & Rule Engine | A6 instance control flow, RuleEngine, OutputValidator, persistence; deterministic |
  | LLM Agent | A6 generation, A7 critic (separate client) |
  |= Path |= |
  | Loop 1 | Two entries share loop1Rounds < 3; every re-run is a new ProcedureRun and passes OutputValidator again |
  | Fallback | Format retries exhausted: hybrid keeps rule result (unattributed), llm marks Run failed. Some pointers invalid: steps flagged unsupported, flow continues. No valid pointer or semantic failure: Judgment kept, flagged for a human |
  | ReviewTask | Drafted inside the instance, travels in the StatePatch, visible only after A1 has merged it (Figure 4a) |
  | Safe point | Checked after every procedure; flag raised here is read by A1 and other instances (Figure 4a) |
endlegend
@enduml
